/P 138 0 R
/T (PlanEsc ridges graph theory and GIS mapping to deliver an intelligent disaster evacuation system. By combining multi-criteria pathfinding, bottleneck flow analysis, and high-ground shelter optimization, the system prevents evacuees from being funneled into flood traps while optimizing traffic and rescue logistics. Operating seamlessly via a Python backend, it offers a practical decision-support tool for disaster management authorities.)
